{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.016532731702105785,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.098694775865110509,"y":0.070948750412137773,"w":0.1215404891967773},{"t":"NATALIE: OK. So who'd that be? The people who work there? And presumably some of the","h":0.017448712855542392,"c":1,"x":0.098680209976315991,"w":0.71827163696289065,"y":0.11439939496100071},{"y":0.13206630519814544,"t":"tourists too?","c":1,"w":0.10339783986409504,"h":0.013280179952704474,"x":0.17054387669425045},{"t":"Yes, both those groups. So we'll have to go to the site to do that, I suppose. But we","y":0.14451554998125471,"x":0.16246076403524873,"c":1,"w":0.66892857869466149,"h":0.018518793849697901},{"h":0.021082606276297655,"x":0.17059902959073678,"y":0.15898972298002878,"t":"might also do some of our interviewing away from the site - we could even contact","w":0.66086578369140625,"c":1},{"t":"some people here in the city, like administrators involved in overseeing tourism.","x":0.17064917613210961,"w":0.62985102335611975,"y":0.17601939126933375,"h":0.017359803225603709,"c":1},{"t":"NATALIE: OK. So we'll need to think about our interview questions and fix times and places for","h":0.0162508080508319,"c":1,"y":0.19173862447755707,"w":0.74094706217447914,"x":0.10277762159445313},{"x":0.17271003310553831,"h":0.017488453778557789,"t":"the meetings. It's all going to take a lot of time.","y":0.20754199932805828,"w":0.3726636759440104,"c":1},{"w":0.65659495035807303,"h":0.018295256633781065,"x":0.16863864972554438,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. And if we can, we should ask our interviewees if they can bring along some","y":0.22159351081506018},{"h":0.013100227000997,"c":1,"y":0.23837209330383025,"x":0.17489714067885145,"t":"numerical data that we can add to support our findings.","w":0.4403291829427084},{"y":0.25856916615135561,"t":"NATALIE:","x":0.10076827756779475,"h":0.011931435098636811,"c":1,"w":0.063895543416341155},{"w":0.1527863311767578,"x":0.17056663320913643,"t":"And photographs?","h":0.016113604757895361,"y":0.25543201720500419,"c":1},{"x":0.17275864786390532,"w":0.66477696736653646,"h":0.017911189857725551,"c":1,"t":"I think we have plenty of those already. But Dr Baker also said we have to establish","y":0.26829286716832168},{"x":0.17271023609909888,"y":0.28365489121732712,"w":0.64426808675130209,"h":0.017655284441261632,"c":1,"t":"with our interviewees whether we can identify them in our case study, or whether"},{"h":0.015768418463717127,"w":0.2286707305908203,"y":0.30137299979509269,"t":"they want to be anonymous.","c":1,"x":0.17267444384883021},{"h":0.0091240498707909623,"y":0.32101937039798656,"t":"NATALIE:","x":0.10282086582223075,"c":1,"w":0.057732753753662117},{"h":0.016024324441826554,"w":0.59670781453450517,"y":0.3153710245105088,"c":1,"x":0.17489712229623952,"t":"Oh, I wouldn't have thought of that. OK, once we've got all this information,"},{"w":0.2595816548665365,"y":0.33121265239755737,"t":"I suppose we have to analyse it.","x":0.17469704890144963,"c":1,"h":0.015800927075676929},{"x":0.10082304513957135,"t":"DAVE:","c":1,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.35174418592830614},{"x":0.17685234444127293,"w":0.63393407185872397,"y":0.34558244761784052,"c":1,"h":0.016571425717626709,"t":"Yes, put it all together and choose what's relevant to the problem we're focusing"},{"y":0.3598035422414585,"t":"on, and analyse that carefully to find out if we can identify any trends or regularities","c":1,"x":0.17473918115438342,"w":0.65874603271484378,"h":0.019738363573773121},{"t":"there. That's the main thing at this stage, rather than concentrating on details or lots","y":0.37612568751242481,"w":0.66688288370768223,"h":0.019169813050538553,"x":0.17479363046790183,"c":1},{"x":0.10276769110216889,"w":0.059896717071533198,"t":"NATALIE:","h":0.010857284420089819,"c":1,"y":0.41244926467897447},{"y":0.42877906966342283,"t":"DAVE:","w":0.043209877014160139,"x":0.10493827125447887,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1},{"x":0.17473180557033136,"t":"OK. And then once we've analysed that, what next?","y":0.4074359277928693,"w":0.41393679300944014,"h":0.017888939703592066,"c":1},{"h":0.0193725963363377,"c":1,"t":"Well, then we need to think about what we do with the data we've selected to make","x":0.17272042515911779,"w":0.66486938476562496,"y":0.42135732370489276},{"c":1,"x":0.17489712592695383,"y":0.43895348822282587,"w":0.62345677693684898,"t":"it as clear as possible to our readers. Things like graphs, or tables, or charts...","h":0.01599350806821509},{"y":0.45930232547112304,"x":0.10288065982467588,"t":"NATALIE:","w":0.059670778910319008,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"w":0.043209877014160139,"t":"DAVE:","x":0.10493827125447887,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"y":0.47529069757039966},{"t":"Right.","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.047325102488199905,"c":1,"x":0.1769547325989603,"y":0.45784883706201818},{"t":"Then the case study itself is mostly quite standard; we begin by presenting the","c":1,"y":0.46874546177256404,"w":0.623662109375,"x":0.17685452881963878,"h":0.017985423125142286},{"c":1,"t":"problem, and giving some background, then go through the main sections, but the","y":0.48477955616675006,"h":0.015734638286001967,"x":0.17892514123349562,"w":0.64831171671549481},{"c":1,"t":"thing that surprised me is that in a normal report we'd end with some suggestions","x":0.17478436336587899,"w":0.64839497884114583,"h":0.018271853982770425,"y":0.49975593810296159},{"y":0.51518449934978627,"c":1,"w":0.66481394449869791,"h":0.01688487116945081,"t":"to deal with the problem or need we identified, but in a case study we end up with a","x":0.17479106703279171},{"t":"question or a series of questions to our readers, and they decide what ought to be","w":0.65257563273111985,"c":1,"x":0.17678449669343582,"y":0.5303807446269464,"h":0.018401895170357729},{"h":0.012069113543794696,"c":1,"t":"done.","x":0.17837184367913186,"y":0.54961086002941573,"w":0.048790251413981106},{"t":"NATALIE:","x":0.10670971271223739,"y":0.56691311981922077,"c":1,"w":0.06846509297688802,"h":0.0099372470617575814},{"c":1,"x":0.17078189447323472,"t":"Oh, I hadn't realised that.","y":0.56389870417985355,"w":0.21193415323893228,"h":0.016043156420524562},{"t":"So basically, the problem we're addressing in our case study of the Horton Castle","c":1,"h":0.018277055944795451,"w":0.6483937581380208,"y":0.59939454188025587,"x":0.17685201034234532},{"y":0.61556271601623658,"w":0.66472106933593744,"x":0.17688649158343858,"c":1,"h":0.016916027900327424,"t":"site is why so few tourists are visiting it. And we'll find out more from our interviews,"},{"t":"but I did find one report on the internet that suggested that one reason might be","y":0.63221436958101929,"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17695473721520386,"w":0.63580245971679694,"c":1},{"t":"because as far as transport goes, access is difficult.","x":0.17890946529457652,"y":0.6478835413459122,"c":1,"w":0.41376749674479163,"h":0.016097096307257974},{"w":0.63194707234700531,"c":1,"h":0.018519434125740752,"t":"I read that too, but that report was actually written ten years ago, when the road","x":0.17888713751070667,"y":0.6612878398314892},{"x":0.17884697868215749,"y":0.67584258310534207,"w":0.63411371866861976,"h":0.02014061531273581,"t":"there was really bad, but that's been improved now. And I think there's plenty of","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"fascinating stuff there for a really good day out, but you'd never realise it from the","y":0.6921150430837093,"w":0.64834304809570309,"x":0.17889845952787076,"h":0.01757783575248939},{"t":"castle website - maybe that's the problem.","x":0.17880732744881175,"h":0.016815431547670401,"w":0.34394882202148436,"c":1,"y":0.70855956492934369},{"c":1,"x":0.17489711608892825,"w":0.24279836018880205,"h":0.013088243729374671,"y":0.72673733777711558,"t":"Yes, it's really dry and boring."},{"h":0.018850420894555464,"w":0.66488845825195309,"t":"I read somewhere a suggestion that what the castle needs is a visitor centre. So we","c":1,"y":0.73694840879291346,"x":0.18093036966450957},{"h":0.017533054059750919,"c":1,"x":0.17888094289506018,"t":"could have a look for some information about that on the internet. What would we","y":0.75350233843659675,"w":0.64839284261067709},{"x":0.18106996128540037,"w":0.11728394826253258,"t":"need to know?","y":0.77179034149828629,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"NATALIE: Well, who'd use it for a start. It'd be good to know what categories the visitors fell","x":0.11098344583227998,"w":0.71221501668294263,"h":0.018445214899465268,"y":0.78406474232108092},{"t":"into too, like school parties or retired people, but I think we'd have to talk to staff to","w":0.65664031982421878,"x":0.17888238447944332,"y":0.79924226710993684,"h":0.019424510367205938,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"get that information.","h":0.014573853765696643,"x":0.18290255673085545,"y":0.81837562258753827,"w":0.16086130777994792},{"h":0.017490202743116856,"t":"OK. And as we're thinking of suggesting a visitor centre we'd also have to look at","w":0.64427103678385422,"c":1,"x":0.18300466273797081,"y":0.83032078033291712},{"y":0.84653612607838824,"t":"potential problems. I mean, obviously it wouldn't be cheap to set up.","h":0.016370065641908682,"x":0.18301019752862041,"w":0.54133550008138021,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"No, but it could be a really good investment. And as it's on a historical site it'd need","x":0.18092703587692446,"y":0.86059030128498282,"w":0.66085149129231768,"h":0.020457387953399908},{"w":0.51258900960286458,"c":1,"t":"to get special planning permission, Iexpect. That might be hard.","x":0.1809321340845754,"y":0.87795708747213064,"h":0.017577869451228523},{"w":0.039094648361206047,"y":0.94331395373771632,"x":0.1111111122134299,"t":"108","h":0.014534882858869502,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.2085117212931315,"x":0.39471442585841338,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96641811852927229,"h":0.017806331737864278},{"w":0.039094651540120484,"t":"Q22","x":0.85185185108179151,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.11482558123932041},{"t":"Q24","x":0.85390946425051573,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.26889534868118092,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120484},{"t":"Q25","y":0.36046511655964419,"x":0.85596707910148706,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.013081394460653373},{"x":0.85802469196762121,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.49999999984397159,"t":"Q26"},{"x":0.86008230375668882,"c":1,"t":"Q27","y":0.67732558125665687,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.039094651540120373}]}